	(text "Gate-voltage supply, GoodDisplay DESPI-C02 topology with the GDEY029T94 section 12 values (ruling R23)\nBoost: L2 + Q1 switched by the panel's GDR, current sense RESE; D5 -> VGH (about +20 V)\nCharge pump: C20 + D6, D7 -> VGL (about -20 V)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 50.8 0)
